TIP:  This old cowboy standard has been covered by many over the years since Bob Nolan wrote it in 1936.  There are minor variations on the lyrics between the artist and the melodic inflections here are from Marty Robbins' version.

TIP:  The lone (Gm) comes at the outro and a regular (G) can be played instead if you like.
  
 
